From c64a07fef7b167c0f603c0f4312d917b8eae5c8f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: halt95 <halt95@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 12:48:52 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 66/97] cudagraph: allow FULL decode graphs for one-token
 prompt tails (port of upstream #58400)

Port of the upstream vLLM change #58400 (Apache-2.0). A prompt tail of one token can run under the FULL decode graph. The
speculative-row rule of v0.30.0 (num_scheduled_tokens == drafts + 1) is kept, because the upstream rule depends
on a later change not in this base.
